Z||000010||Big O||04-16-2000||11:55 AM||||No hurt feelings guys.  I'm bulletproof. You're right.  I need to get better educated in Fiero wisdom and the forum is a great place to do it.  I hit this place at least twice a day.  The story does seem pretty far fetched, but if there's one thing I've learned since getting into the retail business it's that there are people out there who do things different than I would and really don't care what the cost impact is.  This guy is certainly not a Fiero afficianado in the purest sense of the term.  He has money to spend and can afford nice toys.  Apparently he also has a short attention span and wants to move on to something else.  I intend to get in touch with him this week to see if I can arrange a viewing of the car.  I'll let y'all know what I find out.  By the way Stimp, this guy is NOT a low rider. (He did however have the car painted (ugh) candy apple red). ||||reg||1
